WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.730
«I forget everything.»

2
00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:05.970
Four months ago Marco told you his son was starting nursery in September.

3
00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:07.870
You forgot it the same day.

4
00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:09.600
RelAI didn't.

5
00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:12.240
In September the message it prepares for you starts from there.

6
00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:14.520
From his son. Not from the opportunity.

7
00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:16.410
And that's why Marco replies.

8
00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:18.030
And if someone tells you

9
00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:19.880
«let's talk again in September»,

10
00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:21.820
RelAI notes the date.

11
00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:23.720
Until September it doesn't bother them.

12
00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:25.710
In September it brings them back to you.

13
00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:28.550
You forget. It doesn't.
